.TH TILEMAP_FREE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
tilemap_free \- Release the tile array allocated by tilemap_load_csv() and zero the size
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtilemap.h\(dq
.BI "void tilemap_free(Tilemap *m);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Release the tile array allocated by tilemap_load_csv() and zero the size. Do not call on a map whose tiles point at a static array.
.SH MODULE
tilemap (src/engine/tilemap/tilemap.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tilemap_load_csv (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
